Technically, a Limit speciﬁes a boundary of the interval of valid values for a given context (i.e. a data type). Please note thatthe boundary might or might not be part of the interval itself, i.e. the interval might be
open or closed. From the formal point of view, the range represents all real numbersdeﬁned by:

